        "label": "主干",
        "focus": [
          "prog",
          "entry",
          "sched",
          "orch",
          "verify"
        ],
        "note": "run() 的实际顺序：parse → validate → project → instantiate → dispatch_all → 组装 → 独立复核"
      },
      {
        "id": "ident",
        "label": "识别层",
        "focus": [
          "sched",
          "solver",
          "ctf",
          "special"
        ],
        "note": "64 条 derivation rule：backdoor / front-door / Tian / general-ID / IDC / ID*"
      },
      {
        "id": "estim",
        "label": "估计层",
        "focus": [
          "disp",
          "estim",
          "numeric"
        ],
        "note": "identify 之后才谈数值；估计器自己声明它拟合的形态"
      },
      {
        "id": "audit",
        "label": "独立复核",
        "focus": [
          "verify",
          "rules",
          "gaprules",
          "probe"
        ],
        "note": "94 个 rule 名、124 个 verify_* 入口；不 import themis.output"
      },
      {
        "id": "loop",
        "label": "回填闭环",
        "focus": [
          "gapreport",
          "kb",
          "workflow",
          "prog"
        ],
        "note": "缺口翻成 KBQuery，客户端 adapter 做 IO，值回填进程序再跑一遍——整段在一次 run() 之外，所以画成虚线"
      }
    ]
  },
